 "name_en": "Make-to-Order Production – Finished Goods Sales and Final Assembly (BJE)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Make-to-Order Production – Finished Goods Sales and Final Assembly (BJE)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio5398248add3b4d6f83d79a4c68a43855\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5398248add3b4d6f83d79a4c68a43855__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The Make-to-Order process starts with a customer quotation and ends with the clearing of a customer account after a payment is received.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The process starts with the creation of a quote that includes a price and lead time estimate. Once the customer accepts the quote, a sales order is created that references the quote. The billing plan containing multiple customer payments (including down payment) may be set up in the order.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The production process is triggered by a material requirement planning (MRP) run for the finished product and BoM components. Once the finished product is manufactured (and confirmations entered and components issued) and received into stock, the delivery and final billing occurs.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Optionally, you can set up an order BoM that contains the components required for the customer’s specific requirements. A cost estimate can be generated based on an order-specific BoM.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Components can be preplanned using the Semi-finished Goods Planning and Assembly (1BM) scope item.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5398248add3b4d6f83d79a4c68a43855__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Plan production in a make-to-order scenario, optionally with a sales order bill of material</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute production specific to customer requirements and specification</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve usability with intuitive confirmation of production operations</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use billing plan including down payments</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5398248add3b4d6f83d79a4c68a43855__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce inventory costs by initiating production after you receive a customer order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce time between initial customer inquiry to sales order receipt by streamlining the quote to order process</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enable Make-To-Order production</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce master data maintenance efforts by providing sales order BOM processing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase transparency into production and inventory costs by enabling sales-order-specific cost estimates</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute production specific to customer requirements and specification</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve usability with intuitive confirmation of production operations</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Shorten order-to-cash cycle time by enabling flexible billing plan including down payments</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>按订单生产 - 成品销售和最终装配 (BJE)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio5398248add3b4d6f83d79a4c68a43855\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5398248add3b4d6f83d79a4c68a43855__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">按订单生产流程从客户报价开始，到收到付款后清算客户科目结束。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此流程从创建包含价格和提前期估算的报价开始。客户接受报价后，将创建参考报价的销售订单。可以在订单中设置包含多个客户付款（包括预付款）的开票计划。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">生产流程由成品和物料清单组件的物料需求计划 (MRP) 运行触发。制造成品（并输入确认并发出组件）并接收到库存后，将进行交货和最终开票。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">或者，您可以设置订单物料清单，其中包含客户特定需求所需的组件。可根据订单特定的物料清单生成成本估算。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">可以使用半成品计划和装配 (1BM) 范围项目预先计划组件。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5398248add3b4d6f83d79a4c68a43855__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在按订单生产场景中计划生产，可以选择使用销售订单物料清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行特定于客户要求和规范的生产</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过直观的生产操作确认提高可用性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用包括预付款的开票计划</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5398248add3b4d6f83d79a4c68a43855__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">通过在收到客户订单后启动生产，降低库存成本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过简化报价到订单流程，缩短从初始客户询价到销售订单接收之间的时间</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">启用按订单生产</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过提供销售订单物料清单处理，减少主数据维护工作量</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过启用销售订单特定的成本估算，提高生产和库存成本的透明度</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行特定于客户要求和规范的生产</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过直观的生产操作确认提高可用性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过启用包括预付款在内的灵活开票计划，缩短订单到现金的周期时间</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
